# Dependencies — MUST be excluded. The build context is the repo root and the
# Dockerfile does `COPY . .` on top of a fresh Alpine `pnpm install`. Copying the
# host's node_modules clobbers the Alpine-native binaries (e.g. sharp's
# linuxmusl-arm64 build gets overwritten by the host's darwin-arm64 build),
# which breaks the app at runtime.
**/node_modules

# Build output and caches — rebuilt inside the image
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage

# Secrets and local env — never bake into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS and local junk
.git
.gitignore
**/*.log
.DS_Store
images
